<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>FlyLevel</title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport"
          content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <link href="FlyLevel_fitxers/css.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="FlyLevel_fitxers/styles.css"> -->
    <link rel="icon" href="https://sorry.flylevel.com/images/flylevel-favicon-16.png" sizes="16x16">
    <link rel="icon" href="https://sorry.flylevel.com/images/flylevel-favicon-32.png" sizes="32x32">
    <link rel="icon" href="https://sorry.flylevel.com/images/flylevel-favicon-48.png" sizes="48x48">
    <link rel="icon" href="https://sorry.flylevel.com/images/flylevel-favicon-64.png" sizes="64x64">
    <link rel="icon" href="https://sorry.flylevel.com/images/flylevel-favicon-128.png" sizes="128x128">
 <!-- DataLayer init: must be before GTM snippet -->
    <script>
        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
        window.dataLayer.push({
            event: "datalayer-initialized",
            page: {
                path: "sorry.flylevel.com",
                channel: "web",
                customerJourney: "sorry page",
                language: (navigator.language || "es-ES").split('-')[0],
                country: (navigator.language || "es-ES").split('-')[1]?.toUpperCase() || "ES",
                type: "sorry",
                currency:  undefined,
                culture: navigator.language || "es-ES",
                pnr_temporal: undefined
            },
            site: {
                id: "005",
                environment: "PRO"
            },
            user: {
                logged_in: "no",
                id: undefined
            }
        });
    </script>
    <!-- Google Tag Manager -->
    <script>(function(w,d,s,l,i){w[l]=w[l]||[];w[l].push({'gtm.start':
    new Date().getTime(),event:'gtm.js'});var f=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0],
    j=d.createElement(s),dl=l!='dataLayer'?'&l='+l:'';j.async=true;j.src=
    'https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtm.js?id='+i+dl;f.parentNode.insertBefore(j,f);
    })(window,document,'script','dataLayer','GTM-KFT37DM');</script>
    <!-- End Google Tag Manager -->
</head>

<body>
<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->
<noscript><iframe src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-KFT37DM"
height="0" width="0" style="display:none;visibility:hidden"></iframe></noscript>
<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

<body>
<div class="aligner-item">
    <table class="taula" style="padding-bottom:10px;" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="25" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" align="center">
        <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>
                <header>
                    <object type="image/svg+xml" data="images/level-logo.svg">
                        <img src="images/level-logo.png" alt="Level Airlines" border="0" width="142" height="26">
                    </object>

                </header>
                <div class="clearFix"></div>
                <section>
                            <span class="table-styles">
                                <article>
                                    <div class="culture">
                                        <strong>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            Thanks for visiting flylevel.com 
                                        </strong>
                                        <br/>
                                        We are experiencing a technical issue with our systems that is beyond our company's control, and it is affecting our website, reservations, check-in, and airport procedures. We are working to resolve the problem as quickly as possible.
                                         <br/>
                                        <br/>
                                       If you have a flight today we recommend arriving at the airport as early as possible, and check-in through our airport counters in person, even if you have already checked-in online, or already have a boarding pass.
                                        Please remember that our airport counters open 4 hours prior to the flight's departure. We appreciate your understanding and apologize for any inconvenience caused.
                                         <br/>
                                        <br/>
                                        <br/>
                                        Additional information on our official channels.
                                        <br/>
                                        <br/>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                                <article>
                                    <div class="culture">
                                        <strong>
                                            <br/>
                                            <br/>
                                            Gracias por visitar flylevel.com
                                        </strong>
                                        <br/>
                                       Estamos experimentando una incidencia técnica en nuestros sistemas ajena a nuestra compañía y ésta tiene afectación en nuestra página web, reservas, check-in y procesos del aeropuerto. Estamos trabajando para solucionar el problema en la mayor brevedad posible.
                                         <br/>
                                        <br/>
                                      En el caso de tener un vuelo hoy te recomendamos acudir al aeropuerto con la mayor antelación posible y acudir a los mostradores de facturación aunque ya hayas realizado el check-in online. Recuerda que los mostradores abren 4 horas antes de la salida del vuelo. Agradecemos tu comprensión y te pedimos una disculpa por las molestias ocasionadas.
                                        <br/>
                                        <br/>
                                        Más información en nuestros canales oficiales.
                                        <br/>
                                        <br/>
                                    </div>
                                </article>

                                <div class="clearFix"></div>
                            </span>
                </section>
            </td>
        </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <footer>
        <div>
            <p>© 2026 Fly Level</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</div>

<script>
    function setHeightMainContainer() {
        var container = document.querySelector('.aligner-item');
        container.style.height = innerHeight + 'px';
    }

    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
        setHeightMainContainer();
    }, false);
</script>
<style>
    body {
        background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #067fb5, #067fb5 50%, #23893c 50%, #23893c);
        background-size: cover;
        background-color: #111111;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .taula {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 932px;
        margin-top: 16%;
    }

    .aligner-item {
        max-width: 90%;
    }

    .table-styles {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-family: 'Rubik', sans-serif, 'Helvetica', 'Arial', sans-serif;
        color: #111111;
    }

    .clearFix {
        clear: both;
    }

    @media (min-width: 679px) {
        .culture {
            width: 48%;
            float: left;
            padding-left: 1%;
            padding-right: 1%;
        }
    }
    /**
     links
     */

    a {
        color: #067fb5;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
    }

    a:hover {
        color: #067fb5;
    }
    /**
     footer section
     */

    footer div {
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    footer div p {
        text-align: center;
        font-family: 'Rubik', sans-serif, 'Helvetica', 'Arial', sans-serif;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: .8em;
    }
</style>

</body>

</html>